{
  "packet": "cc2_unit_instance_layout",
  "worktree": "agent/cc2-unit-instance-layout",
  "ghidra": "read-only",
  "names_are_hypotheses": true,
  "doc": "docs/UNIT_INSTANCE_LAYOUT.md",
  "subject": "The 0x1188-byte unit instance a vehicle-class descriptor's vtable slot +28h allocates, its six-level constructor chain, and the placement path 00928860/009258F0/006FE620.",
  "headline": {
    "was": "006FE460 BSP_UnitInstance_Construct is the instance constructor; it sets the vtable 00CFC3D0 (docs/SCENE_UNIT_CREATORS.md).",
    "is": "006FE460 is the most derived of six constructors. It writes eight vtable pointers and the dword 7 at +C4h and nothing else; 0081ED40, 0095CC90, 0087B670, 0077EED0, 00928630 and 00925CE0 write every other field, and the deepest is a scene-graph node.",
    "evidence": "006fe460 body 006FE460..006FE4C2 is 98 bytes: CALL 0081ED40, eight MOV [ESI+off],imm and MOV [ESI+C4h],7. Each level of the chain writes its own depth to +C4h (0, 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 7)."
  },
  "corrections": [
    {
      "doc": "docs/SCENE_UNIT_CREATORS.md",
      "was": "006FE620 pushes the instance onto five intrusive lists of the parent node, at parent +30h, +48h, +54h, +60h and +6Ch.",
      "is": "Six lists. 00928560, which 006FE620 calls first at 006FE623, pushes onto the list at parent+24h through the same 00484540.",
      "evidence": "00928560 body 00928560..0092856C: PUSH ECX / MOV ECX,[ECX+30h] / ADD ECX,24h / CALL 00484540 / RET."
    },
    {
      "doc": "docs/SCENE_UNIT_CREATORS.md",
      "was": "006FE620 is exported but has no known caller.",
      "is": "It is 00CFC3D0+130h and is reached only through the indirect call at 009288F1 inside 00928860. No direct call site exists in the image.",
      "evidence": "dword at 00CFC500 (= 00CFC3D0+130h) is 006FE620; 009288F1 CALL EAX with EAX = [[ESI]+130h]."
    },
    {
      "doc": "docs/FIXED_STEP_JOB_WAVES.md",
      "was": "Eight call sites of 00875890 pass group 0 and one passes 3.",
      "is": "Site 0087B6A9 constructs the node at instance+310h with group 0, and 0081ED40 then overwrites the group index at +324h (node +14h) with 1 before the object is finished. The effective group for a unit instance is 1.",
      "evidence": "0087B69B PUSH EDI(0) / LEA EBX,[ESI+310h]; 0081ED40 decompile param_1[0xc9] = 1, byte offset 0x324 = 310h + 14h. 0095CC90 writes 0 to the same field earlier."
    }
  ],
